  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-1",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "A developer who has written WebRTC browser apps from scratch says that architecture \"turns into a complicated mess real fast,\" especially at less well-equipped startups. They called Calls \"the right way to actually solve the problem.\"",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-2",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "Critic sees Calls as another attempt to make Cloudflare \"the central server of the Internet.\" They worry that one major outage could take half the Internet down, and they object to centralizing critical network functions with one provider.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-3",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "User questions the privacy pitch of routing all participants through Cloudflare instead of peer-to-peer. Instead of sharing their IP with a therapist, they would be revealing to a third party that they talked to a therapist. They also fear being barred from WebRTC services based on metadata Cloudflare collects.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-4",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "Commenters note Cloudflare said \"encryption\" but not \"end-to-end encryption.\" They ask whether Cloudflare, as the middleman, would have access to decrypted media streams.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-5",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "Developer building a one-to-one WebRTC product wanted a standalone TURN service first. They want peer-to-peer connections when possible, with TURN relays in every Cloudflare datacenter as a fallback, rather than routing everything through Calls.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-6",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "The main author of the open-source Janus WebRTC server objected to Cloudflare pitching Calls as a replacement for Janus and mediasoup deployments. They called targeting open-source projects that rely on consulting income \"a d*ck move,\" unlike competing with Agora or Twilio.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-7",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32994757",
    "excerpt": "User in education says Calls could be very useful for their use case and is looking forward to it. Another commenter sees it as a direct competitor to Twilio's WebRTC offering.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "adc79abbaf8c7bc1cee02144500a59e444bf5801eecc4f1979f6478647704963"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-8",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=39929876",
    "excerpt": "A WebRTC practitioner called the Calls architecture writeup great. They said it dispels the FUD that \"you can not scale WebRTC\": harder than HTTP, but not intrinsically harder than other media.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-09T23:51:47.032Z",
    "sourceHash": "48773807dc88c519233e6b9e22bab333f48cdbbe12e5e919373b81596e47d559"
  },
  {
    "id": "cloudflare-realtime-comm-9",
